          "id": "1795656624831",
          "type": "text",
          "content": "Rare unlisted enemy drops:\n- Cursed Blade (From the Phantom enemies outside the castle and in the upper floor. They also drop from Poltergeist enemies in the upper floor)\n- Lyrian Longsword (From the Vampire Page enemies). Evolves into Lyrian Greatsword\n\n**PLEASE NOTE:**\n1. If you're a Vampire or Undead, the red doors will ALWAYS be open for you, otherwise you'll need to use a blood spell.\n2. The White VHS Tape is the only non-completionist requirement for ending E so you might want to hold off doing this if you want to see all endings in one save file!\n3. The White VHS Quest, if done before 1.0, you'll have to do save manipulation to get it back. Just open the game files, find your save file + slot (file is .MIDNIGHT) and open with a text editor changing White VHS Tape from 00 to 01."
